<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:27.360
<b>Mini Devil Type</b>

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:33.560
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Pico Dart</b>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.970
PicoDevimon.

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Mini Devil T</b>

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:33.740
His attack, Pico Dart, throws 
giant syringes at the opponent.

00:22:33.740 --> 00:22:36.390
Um, I have a slight fever.

00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:39.570
He's not a doctor!

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:43.810
We're on the Hell's Field 
created by Apollomon!

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:46.910
Taiki, let's decide the 
winner of our game!

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:50.550
This isn't a game! It's reality, Yuu!

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:52.320
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Life or Death,</b>

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Hell's Battle of the Generals!</b>

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:54.450
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
